uestreview-3990272319","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114168","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-23T09:09:23Z"},{"id":4026865138,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7wBRXy","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"<img width=\"507\" height=\"156\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1a04594-5130-49c2-a496-ba51775579b4\" />\r\n\r\nSome issues: \r\n- The icon is not centered in the line.\r\n- The popup is not at the icon when the icon is clicked. When the shortcut is used, it is good to have at the caret, but it should be at the icon when using the mouse.\r\n- Hovering over the icon should change the mouse cursor to not be the text editing bar.\r\n- Hovering over the icon should show a tooltip saying what it does like \"Show Code Actions\" and the shortcut.\r\n\r\n\r\nIn other IDEs when there are multiple completions on a line, only the ones valid at the caret location are shown. Not sure if possible to change with current warning info or if it is needed. It's in order so it might be fine.\r\n<img width=\"468\" height=\"246\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e4463b4-319b-414d-827b-5d92d6b0f1e8\" />","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168#pullrequestreview-4026865138","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114168","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-03-29T16:08:07Z"},{"id":3982255331,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6S