ls/114168","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-04T05:38:03Z"},{"id":4058754081,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7x66wh","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168#pullrequestreview-4058754081","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114168","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-04T18:45:33Z"},{"id":4058244487,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7x4-WH","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168#pullrequestreview-4058244487","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114168","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-13T08:55:05Z"},{"id":4261720631,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7-BLI3","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"f3dd7d3311518198f31df144ba30fa521085554d","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","login":"AdriaandeJongh","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh"},"body":"LGTM from a usability perspective! \n\nDidn't look at the code.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168#pullrequestreview-4261720631","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114168","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-05-11T08:06:14Z"},{"id":4070393863,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7ynUgH","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"f6edc05ed534ba7c9505a5a30acca05edff1c591","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"> Multi-document undo redo (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168#issuecomment-3830464005)\r\n\r\nDo any of the current Code Actions work on multiple documents at once? If none of the current actions need it could be done later.\r\nI tested how VSCode handles multiple document undo redo, and they work as long as the files are at the same undo level as when the action was done (a warning shows if any documents were changed and couldn't do the undo/redo with the rest). We don't have anything for it yet, but it makes sense to me to have it work across multiple documents for code actions.\r\nI have a plan of how the undo/redo can work with multiple documents:\r\n1. When a multi-document edit happens, save the file names and their undo versions (`TextEdit::get_version()`) in a new undo stack on ScriptEditor\r\n2. Intercept undo and redo action handling before the TextEdit gets it (either with existing `_text_edit_gui_input` or a new one in ScriptEditor). On undo/redo, if the TextEdit current undo version matches the undo version in the current item in the stack, then we are going to do a multi-document undo/redo. If it does not match, don't accept the event and let TextEdit get the undo/redo like normal.\r\n3. For the multi-document undo/redo, accept the undo/redo event, do an undo/redo in the current TextEdit, and check all the other files saved in the current undo stack item. If they are open and if their current undo version matches then undo/redo in those TextEdits too. And then move the stack position to the previous/next item.\r\n\t1. If the undo version does not match, warn the user about all the files that failed.\r\n4. When a document is closed, go through all items in the undo stack and mark that file if it has it so it can no longer be a part of the multi-document undo/redo. This is because the TextEdit undo/redo stack is not saved when its closed.\r\n\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114168#pullrequestreview-4070393863","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114168","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-05-15T21:12:23Z"},{"id":4302823014,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAHfeZg","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"f6edc05ed534ba7c9505a5a30acca05edff1c591","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?u=64fc5e539030609be0447a74243d9fc643fa9bf3&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","login":"Meorge","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gist